--   2026_10_26_000001_create_letter_template_defs        tabel letter_template_defs  + 6 templat surat bawaan
--   2026_10_26_000002_add_offering_letter_design          templat Offering Letter (sudah termasuk dalam 6 baris di atas)
--   2026_10_27_000001_create_employee_master_settings     tabel employee_field_options + employee_section_settings + isi bawaannya
